  "source_revision_note": "source_commit identifies the Android 0.3.0 baseline only. Capture recovery and the shared DtmfParser, SipInfoDtmf, InbandDtmf, KeyAnalysis, CallFlow, WaveformData and WaveformViewport were synchronized from the Android 0.5.0 working tree. files_sha256 records the current identical imported sources, including unchanged upstream G.729 sources. Desktop AudioPreview adapts the Android class with a desktop package. CaptureWorkspace is synchronized from the Android 0.6.0 working tree for independent multi-file selection and lightweight per-file view state. Call discovery and optional disk-backed large-capture parsing are synchronized from the Android 0.7.0 working tree; Android retains the default 128 MiB / 64 MiB limits, and Windows uses the 1 GiB disk-backed mode. TLS/WS transport, independently imported session keys and Opus media support are synchronized from the Android 0.8.0 working tree."
